# Morrowind Temple: joining. In the Ald'ruhn Temple Tuls Valen takes the player in ("join the Temple": "Join the
# Temple" 1, PCRaiseRank).
# PositionCell stands in for the travel. The chain starts from the authored Morrowind.esm + Tribunal + Bloodmoon
# instance's last save.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_co_estate --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tt_join
run
player->PositionCell 3637 3900 14723 0 "Ald-ruhn, Temple"
until 600 "tuls valen"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk tuls valen
ask join the Temple
choose 1
expect player->GetPCRank Temple >= 0
bye
end
